message: If you use this work, please cite it as below.
title: "A 406H obstruction at an earlier height in the 547/727 race"
abstract: "At log centre 1620542.278 a qualifying gain by 406.729H in the 547/727 prime-ideal race forces a zero of one of eight odd Dirichlet factors in an explicitly bounded region. The finite implication is unconditional. The primitive Dirichlet critical-line theorem therefore excludes the gain."
